1. Sequence Name: name (string)
2. mcg: McGeoch's method for signal sequence prediction (real)
3. gvh: von Heijne's method for signal sequence prediction (real)
4. lip: von Heijne's "Sequence Statistics" method score (real)
5. chg: Presence of charge on amino acid (real)
6. aac: Amino acid composition (real)
7. alm1: ALOM method score (first run) (real)
8. alm2: ALOM method score (second run) (real)
9. target: Localization site (class attribute)
   cp: cytoplasmic
   im: inner membrane without signal sequence
   pp: periplasmic
   imU: inner membrane, uncleavable
   om: outer membrane
   omL: outer membrane lipoprotein
   imL: inner membrane lipoprotein
   imS: inner membrane, cleavable

